"Weak factorial invariance constrains the whole of the factor loading matrix to equality across groups, making all group differences in observed covariances attributable to differences in the factor covariance structure" (Wu & Estabrook, 2016 <https://doi.org/10.1007/s11336-016-9506-0>, p. 1017)

