> standardizedSolution(fit)
> parameterestimates(fit)
>
> ... yield the same p-value results

Exactly?  To how many decimals?

print(standardizedSolution(fit), nd = 7)
print(parameterEstimates(fit), nd = 7)

They are usually quite close, but identical would be coincidence.

